cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Kavier, please cite it as below.
title: >-
  Kavier: Simulating the Performance, Sustainability, and Efficiency of LLM
  Ecosystems under Inference and Training
abstract: >-
  LLM workloads, such as training, fine-tuning, and inference, are becoming
  too large even for massive-scale infrastructure. Kavier is a physics-driven
  simulator that predicts the performance, sustainability, and efficiency of
  LLM ecosystems under inference and fine-tuning workloads.
